#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:8
msgid "迁移既有集成"
msgstr "Migrate an existing integration"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:10
msgid ""
"将此前开发快照中的集成迁移到 SDK 0.0.1 时，使用新的构建目录和安装前缀。配置 ABI 为 `5`，线上协议为 Wire v1。按[构建与消费](build-and-"
"consume.md)重新构建产品，配套使用同一档位和资源组合的库与生成头，继续链接 `xgl::xgl`。"
msgstr ""
"When moving an integration from an earlier development snapshot to SDK 0.0.1, use a new build directory "
"and install prefix. The configuration ABI is `5` and the protocol is Wire v1. Follow [Build and "
"consume](build-and-consume.md) to rebuild each product with the matching generated header, library, "
"profile and resource selection. Continue linking `xgl::xgl`."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:12
msgid "线上协议与应用"
msgstr "Protocol and application changes"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:14
msgid ""
"**核对链路上端点和中继的 Wire v1 编码。** 版本字段为 `1`。迁移使用早期 Wire v1 编码的产品时，同步替换端点和中继，使帧标志位和 TLV 编号一致。基本帧头布局及 CRC "
"算法见[线格式](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Check the Wire v1 encoding for each endpoint and relay on the path.** The version field is `1`. When "
"migrating from an earlier Wire v1 encoding, replace endpoints and relays together so that frame flags "
"and TLV assignments agree. See [Wire Format](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md) for the fixed "
"header layout and CRC algorithm."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:15
msgid "**移除旧 `XGL_TRAFFIC_ENCRYPTION_*` 常量的引用。** 流量类别只携带优先级和可靠性。"
msgstr ""
"**Remove references to the former `XGL_TRAFFIC_ENCRYPTION_*` constants.** Traffic class carries only "
"priority and reliability."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:16
msgid ""
"**每次发送提交一个完整 DATA 帧。** 超出完整帧上限返回 `XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`。大数据改用[应用分块](send.md)，可参考文件传输与固件更新示例。接收 DATA "
"的实例需要配置接纳回调；纯发送端可使用空回调处理 ACK 和 CONTROL。"
msgstr ""
"**Submit one frame's worth of DATA per call.** Remove the previous fragmentation setting and split "
"larger transfers into [application blocks](send.md#application-blocks). The sender returns "
"`XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL` when a payload exceeds the single-frame budget."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:17
msgid ""
"**核对可靠通信的[双向 MTU](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)。** 分别检查 DATA 路径和 ACK "
"回程。缺失本地反向路由或反馈预算不足时，接收端在接纳前报错。"
msgstr ""
"**Check MTU in both directions.** Verify the DATA path and the ACK return path independently. The "
"receiver reports a missing local reverse route or insufficient feedback capacity before accepting "
"reliable DATA. See [Routing](../reference/protocol/v1/routing.md)."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:19
msgid "配置与存储"
msgstr "Configuration and storage"

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:21
msgid ""
"移除代码中的分片开关、整消息字节预算和重组槽配置，同时清理 CMake 的 `fragmentation` "
"组件请求，以及使用旧消息槽选项、重组超时、内存报告或资源快照字段的代码。`XGL_INSTANCE_OPTIONS_INIT` 初始化版本 2 的运行选项描述符，填写尺寸、版本和构建身份。带 scope "
"的回调、已安装 scope 的认证策略和可靠发送忙期选项继续可用。"
msgstr ""
"Remove the fragmentation configuration fields, the CMake `fragmentation` component requirement and any "
"references to fragmentation workspace or resource counts. Continue using `XGL_INSTANCE_OPTIONS_INIT` to "
"construct the version 2 advanced options descriptor. It supplies the required size, version and build "
"identity. Scoped callbacks, installed-scope authentication and the reliable TX lifetime option remain "
"available."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:23
msgid ""
"通过 `xgl_memory_requirements()` 或 `xgl_memory_report_with_options()` "
"重新测量实际所需存储及对齐。配置和回调上下文须活到销毁结束。动态创建继续使用公开的 `xgl_allocator_t`，分配器描述符和上下文也须活到销毁结束。Checked 入口校验配置大小、ABI "
"和构建身份。"
msgstr ""
"Measure aligned storage again with `xgl_memory_requirements()` or `xgl_memory_report_with_options()` "
"before allocating the workspace. Keep the configuration, callbacks and allocator descriptor alive until "
"destruction. The checked entry points validate configuration size, ABI and build identity."

#: docs/zh/guides/migration.md:25
msgid ""
"定制编译帧长时，配置库的 "
"`XGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE`，然后重新安装生成头和库。发布检查见[互操作](../reference/protocol/v1/interoperability.md)与[验证](../development/validation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"For a custom compiled frame ceiling, set `-DXGL_DATALINK_MAX_FRAME_SIZE=<bytes>` when configuring the "
"library. Reinstall the generated header and library together. See "
"[Interoperability](../reference/protocol/v1/interoperability.md) and "
"[Validation](../development/validation.md) for the release checks."

